{
  "thinkerId": "aesop",
  "editoriallyReviewed": true,
  "items": [
    {
      "text": "It is wise to turn circumstances to good account.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 30942,
      "endOffset": 30991
    },
    {
      "text": "Self-help is the best help.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 36697,
      "endOffset": 36724
    },
    {
      "text": "No arguments will give courage to the coward.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 42139,
      "endOffset": 42184
    },
    {
      "text": "One story is good, till another is told.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 45624,
      "endOffset": 45664
    },
    {
      "text": "Misfortune tests the sincerity of friends.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 48640,
      "endOffset": 48682
    },
    {
      "text": "No one truly forgets injuries in the presence of him who caused the injury.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 57793,
      "endOffset": 57868
    },
    {
      "text": "Better poverty without care, than riches with.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 81483,
      "endOffset": 81529
    },
    {
      "text": "We must make friends in prosperity if we would have their help in adversity.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 91193,
      "endOffset": 91269
    },
    {
      "text": "Our mere anticipations of life outrun its realities.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 103593,
      "endOffset": 103645
    },
    {
      "text": "Misfortunes springing from ourselves are the hardest to bear.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 125388,
      "endOffset": 125449
    },
    {
      "text": "Men often bear little grievances with less courage than they do large misfortunes.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 126329,
      "endOffset": 126412
    },
    {
      "text": "No one can be a friend if you know not whether to trust or distrust him.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 132226,
      "endOffset": 132298
    },
    {
      "text": "It is easy to kick a man that is down.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 164905,
      "endOffset": 164943
    },
    {
      "text": "Men of evil reputation, when they perform a good deed, fail to get credit for it.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 166346,
      "endOffset": 166427
    },
    {
      "text": "A man is known by the company he keeps.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 184863,
      "endOffset": 184902
    },
    {
      "text": "It is absurd to ape our betters.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 189971,
      "endOffset": 190003
    },
    {
      "text": "Self-interest alone moves some men.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 190697,
      "endOffset": 190732
    },
    {
      "text": "We had better bear our troubles bravely than try to escape them.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 199682,
      "endOffset": 199746
    },
    {
      "text": "The tyrant will always find a pretext for his tyranny.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 30336,
      "endOffset": 30390
    },
    {
      "text": "I would rather have one barleycorn than all the jewels in the world.\"",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 34251,
      "endOffset": 34320
    },
    {
      "text": "In serving the wicked, expect no reward, and be thankful if you escape injury for your pains.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 35484,
      "endOffset": 35577
    },
    {
      "text": "The loiterer often blames delay on his more active friend.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 37613,
      "endOffset": 37671
    },
    {
      "text": "Slow but steady wins the race.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 40106,
      "endOffset": 40136
    },
    {
      "text": "Birds of a feather flock together.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 41209,
      "endOffset": 41243
    },
    {
      "text": "The greatest kindness will not bind the ungrateful.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 41636,
      "endOffset": 41687
    },
    {
      "text": "Fair weather friends are not worth much.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 42807,
      "endOffset": 42847
    },
    {
      "text": "Don't make much ado about nothing.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 43114,
      "endOffset": 43148
    },
    {
      "text": "If men had all they wished, they would be often ruined.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 44511,
      "endOffset": 44566
    },
    {
      "text": "Pleasure bought with pains, hurts.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 45027,
      "endOffset": 45061
    },
    {
      "text": "If words suffice not, blows must follow.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 46297,
      "endOffset": 46337
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Never travel with a friend who deserts you at the approach of danger.\"",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 48567,
      "endOffset": 48638
    },
    {
      "text": "Zeal should not outrun discretion.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 49407,
      "endOffset": 49441
    },
    {
      "text": "Change of habit cannot alter Nature.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 49955,
      "endOffset": 49991
    },
    {
      "text": "Do not attempt to hide things which cannot be hid.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 50361,
      "endOffset": 50411
    },
    {
      "text": "The value is in the worth, not in the number.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 54262,
      "endOffset": 54307
    },
    {
      "text": "Do not attempt too much at once.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 56397,
      "endOffset": 56429
    },
    {
      "text": "Evil companions bring more hurt than profit.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 60994,
      "endOffset": 61038
    },
    {
      "text": "Do not be in a hurry to change one evil for another.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 62632,
      "endOffset": 62684
    },
    {
      "text": "Little liberties are great offenses.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 63135,
      "endOffset": 63171
    },
    {
      "text": "Old friends cannot with impunity be sacrificed for new ones.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 65080,
      "endOffset": 65140
    },
    {
      "text": "Notoriety is often mistaken for fame.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 65741,
      "endOffset": 65778
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever you do, do with all your might.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 66795,
      "endOffset": 66835
    },
    {
      "text": "Pride goes before destruction.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 70283,
      "endOffset": 70313
    },
    {
      "text": "There is no believing a liar, even when he speaks the truth.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 75104,
      "endOffset": 75164
    },
    {
      "text": "Time and place often give the advantage to the weak over the strong.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 75950,
      "endOffset": 76018
    },
    {
      "text": "Example is more powerful than precept.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 78650,
      "endOffset": 78688
    },
    {
      "text": "Benefits bestowed upon the evil-disposed increase their means of injuring you.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 82987,
      "endOffset": 83065
    },
    {
      "text": "Equals make the best friends.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 83387,
      "endOffset": 83416
    },
    {
      "text": "Hypocritical speeches are easily seen through.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 83863,
      "endOffset": 83909
    },
    {
      "text": "What's bred in the bone will stick to the flesh.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 84262,
      "endOffset": 84310
    },
    {
      "text": "The memory of a good deed lives.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 85752,
      "endOffset": 85784
    },
    {
      "text": "Children are not to be blamed for the faults of their parents.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 87066,
      "endOffset": 87128
    },
    {
      "text": "Avoid a remedy that is worse than the disease.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 89021,
      "endOffset": 89067
    },
    {
      "text": "The least outlay is not always the greatest gain.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 89597,
      "endOffset": 89646
    },
    {
      "text": "False confidence often leads into danger.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 94535,
      "endOffset": 94576
    },
    {
      "text": "The more honor the more danger.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 95707,
      "endOffset": 95738
    },
    {
      "text": "Evil wishes, like chickens, come home to roost.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 102123,
      "endOffset": 102170
    },
    {
      "text": "In quarreling about the shadow we often lose the substance.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 105043,
      "endOffset": 105102
    },
    {
      "text": "The hero is brave in deeds as well as words.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 107608,
      "endOffset": 107652
    },
    {
      "text": "Do nothing without a regard to the consequences.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 113777,
      "endOffset": 113825
    },
    {
      "text": "It sometimes happens that one man has all the toil, and another all the profit.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 115043,
      "endOffset": 115122
    },
    {
      "text": "In avoiding one evil, care must be taken not to fall into another.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 115471,
      "endOffset": 115537
    },
    {
      "text": "Every man should be content to mind his own business.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 116245,
      "endOffset": 116298
    },
    {
      "text": "There are times when the small and lowly are the strongest to do mischief.\"",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 117597,
      "endOffset": 117672
    },
    {
      "text": "It shows an evil disposition to take advantage of a friend in distress.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 119801,
      "endOffset": 119872
    },
    {
      "text": "The best intentions will not always ensure success.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 121334,
      "endOffset": 121385
    },
    {
      "text": "Everyone is more or less master of his own fate.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 122748,
      "endOffset": 122796
    },
    {
      "text": "Happy is the man who learns from the misfortunes of others.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 124607,
      "endOffset": 124666
    },
    {
      "text": "Contentment with our lot is an element of happiness.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 128029,
      "endOffset": 128081
    },
    {
      "text": "In a change of government the poor change nothing beyond the name of their master.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 128874,
      "endOffset": 128956
    },
    {
      "text": "The desire for imaginary benefits often involves the loss of present blessings.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 129225,
      "endOffset": 129304
    },
    {
      "text": "Count the cost before you commit yourselves.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 130259,
      "endOffset": 130303
    },
    {
      "text": "Be on guard against men who can strike from a distance.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 130942,
      "endOffset": 130997
    },
    {
      "text": "Use serves to overcome dread.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 131391,
      "endOffset": 131420
    },
    {
      "text": "Two blacks do not make one white.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 133027,
      "endOffset": 133060
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine feathers don't make fine birds.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 133514,
      "endOffset": 133550
    },
    {
      "text": "Every tale is not to be believed.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 137265,
      "endOffset": 137298
    },
    {
      "text": "Necessity is the mother of invention.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 139322,
      "endOffset": 139359
    },
    {
      "text": "A willful man will have his way to his own hurt.",
      "sourceId": "887979e7-7954-4b54-8f46-04a727e4d569",
      "sourceTitle": "Aesop’s Fables",
      "sourceFile": "aesop_works_1.txt",
      "sourceKind": "database-text",
      "startOffset": 139958,
      "endOffset": 140006
    }
  ]
}
